    "note": "Yoke and switch panel are one USB device. VID:PID 294B:1900 'Alpha Flight Controls' per the linux-hardware.org USB database. Each panel switch reports one button per position. The older entry 294B:0102 was unverified and is probably wrong. Rocker 'up' = forward. yoke.button.2, yoke.rocker.3/4 (horizontal rockers listed as yoke.switch.3/4 left/right) and panel.toggle.4 'LIGHTS' (the panel has five separate light switches, toggle.6-10) stay without input. Button numbering not confirmed by public documentation (originally derived from a local game configuration file); verify on a real device."
